      "writtenOn": "2026-04-14T21:14:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, so when this feature is enabled, the device should give a random MAC address every time theres a connection, whether to a new network or not. It\u0027s already a bit confusing because of the overly technical language (which was because this was pulled out of Developer Settings). See suggested string name change here: https://review.calyxos.org/c/CalyxOS/platform_packages_apps_Settings/+/44962/comments/2c079624_941cfa49\n\nThat being said, I\u0027m trying to keep the instructions for the testing outside this checklist. In parenthesis, I\u0027m only including the location of the setting. I will keep it as is for now.",
